  "description": "Test the system under test in-process from inside a TestFramework timeline, with its own dependencies replaced by declared test doubles. Packs declare a double once; MockEnvironment hosts the application's real service composition with the doubles standing in; MockExt.Host calls into it, awaiting async calls; and what the doubles record becomes findable run artifacts, verified from the frozen run.",
