  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - needs TestFramework.Core 0.7.0; MockDefinition<T> is MockPack<T>, run.MockResult<T>(label) is run.HostResult<T>(label), and Include refuses a pack whose service the composition never registers - use IncludeAdditional to add one. A pack is checked when it is included, and a double called after its run has finished still answers but is not recorded. New: out and ref parameters, set up with MockArg.Ref<T>.Any and written back with Assigns, and synchronous Host calls that take the step's CancellationToken.",
